    "title": "Both sides rest, closing arguments set for Friday in Tyler capital murder sentencing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By JD Conte ,\n11 hours ago TYLER, Texas (KLTV) - Both sides have rested and closing arguments have been set in the sentencing phase for a Tyler man convicted of capital murder. Jamaurea Jermaine Britton, 22, was convicted of capital murder in the 2023 death of 18-year-old Dejah Hood. Jurors are considering whether to sentence Britton... Read full article",
